abstract: "Electric arc furnace steelmaking is a nonlinear thermo-metallurgical batch process requiring coordinated control of electrical power, oxygen, natural gas, melting progress, slag behavior, and tapping readiness under safety constraints. This repository provides the benchmark implementation for a safe hybrid agentic control framework using an enhanced hybrid Model C simulator and fourteen control policies."
